</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>All these once were sinners,</l><l>Defiled in His sight,</l><l>Now arrayed in pure garments,</l><l>In praise they unite.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>He maketh the rebel</l><l>A priest and a king,</l><l>He hath bought us, and taught us</l><l>This new song to sing.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>How helpless and hopeless</l><l>We sinners had been,</l><l>If He never had loved us till</l><l>Cleansed from our sin.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Aloud in His praises</l><l>Our voices shall ring,</l><l>So that others, believing,</l><l>This new song shall sing.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
